body:
Love the layout and set up. Two key issues;
1. The units become fixed - units/day or mins/day. Would like for this to be flexible.
2. I have reading and meditation habits on timer. I noticed that after using these timers on iPhone or Apple Watch, my activity stats - calories - were way way too high. I had sat and did nothing but read or breathe but the app had made Heath data count these in. Had to manually delete health data which got tedious.
